{"_id": "c6d13faa-dd3c-44d9-a79d-99383e19495d", "_type": "handbook.guide", "_createdAt": "2026-01-01T00:03:00Z", "title": "SEO Best Practices", "description": "How to make your content discoverable through search engines.", "content": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "a1", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a1c1", "text": "Page Titles and Meta Descriptions", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a2", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a2c1", "text": "Every page needs a unique ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a2c2", "text": "title", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a2c3", "text": " and ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a2c4", "text": "meta description", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a2c5", "text": ". The title appears in the browser tab and as the clickable headline in search results. The meta description is the summary shown below it.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a14", "style": "blockquote", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a14c1", "text": "Write headings for people, not search engines. A heading that clearly describes its section also works well in search.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a3", "style": "normal", "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1, "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a3c1", "text": "Keep titles under 60 characters to avoid truncation.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a4", "style": "normal", "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1, "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a4c1", "text": "Keep meta descriptions between 120 and 160 characters.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a5", "style": "normal", "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1, "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a5c1", "text": "Include the brand name in the title, typically at the end.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "handbook.callout", "_key": "a6", "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "a6b1", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a6b1c1", "text": "If no SEO title is set, the page title is used instead. Only set one when search results need a different or more descriptive headline.", "marks": []}]}], "variant": "tip"}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a8", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a8c1", "text": "Social Preview Images", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a9", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a9c1", "text": "When a page is shared on social media, the preview shows an image with the title and description. If the page has no social image, its featured image is used instead, and if it has neither, the site logo is used. Upload a social image for every page where possible, since previews with a relevant image get more clicks.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "a11", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "a11c1", "text": "Social images should be ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a11c2", "text": "1200 x 630", "marks": ["code"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "a11c3", "text": " pixels, as a PNG or JPEG.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "handbook.image", "_key": "a10", "alt": "Example social preview card showing the site logo as a fallback image", "asset": {"_type": "image", "_sanityAsset": "image@file://./images/62b8ca6085d55da501f4098a056e315eaa4ec016-1200x630.jpg"}, "caption": "A social preview that uses the site logo because the page has no image of its own."}]}
